  "description": "Five years ago, Hyun-Ju suffered from post-traumatic stress disorder and dissociative memory disorder due to an incident. Nevertheless, Hyun-Ju, who is continuing his bright college life, appears in front of his friend, Min-Jun, who went to study in the United States. Unlike the shy high school days, Min-Jun approaches Hyun-Ju without hesitation, perhaps due to American influence, and now Hyun-Ju feels unfamiliar with Min-Jun - his heart is shaken. But the longer he spends time with Min-Jun, the more the past that has sunk deep in his memory begins to come back to life! \n\n(Source: Kakao)",
